## 1. The Two APIs

| API | Endpoint | Timeout | Purpose |
|-----|----------|---------|---------|
| **OE** (Online/E-Commerce) | `https://mes.master.com.pk/get_oe_orders` | 600s (10 min) | Shopify/web orders |
| **POS** (Point of Sale) | `https://mes.master.com.pk/get_pos_orders` | 120s | In-store/dealer orders |

**Auth:** `Authorization: H2rcLQPfzYoV55k9ZyT5aWkyyMKEyxHhX1r3ntrkrvrGeVL4dOsGv3EcQMY2`  
**Request params:** `start_date=YYYY-MM-DD&end_date=YYYY-MM-DD` (optional `limit`)  
**Response:** JSON array or `{"data": [...]}` wrapper

