| Column | Type | Notes |
|--------|------|-------|
| [id](file:///Users/clustox_1/Documents/MasterGroup-RecommendationSystem/recommendation-engine-service/src/data_loader.py#492-511) | varchar PK | OE: numeric string, POS: varies |
| `order_type` | varchar NOT NULL | `OE` or `POS` |
| `source_type` | varchar | Same as order_type (added later) |
| `order_date` | timestamp | Parsed from API |
| `order_name` | varchar | Human-readable order name |
| [order_status](file:///Users/clustox_1/Documents/MasterGroup-RecommendationSystem/recommendation-engine-service/src/main.py#1850-1972) | varchar | See status breakdown below |
| `customer_name` | varchar | Raw name |
| `customer_email` | varchar | |
| `customer_phone` | varchar | |
| `customer_city` | varchar | Raw city string |
| `customer_address` | text | |
| `unified_customer_id` | varchar | `phone_firstname` synthetic key |
| `total_price` | numeric | Order total in PKR |
| `payment_mode` | varchar | Cash, Bank Transfer... |
| `brand_name` | varchar | |
| `items_json` | **jsonb** | Full line-items array stored as JSON |
| [province](file:///Users/clustox_1/Documents/MasterGroup-RecommendationSystem/recommendation-engine-service/src/main.py#5161-5220) | varchar | Normalized province |
| [region](file:///Users/clustox_1/Documents/MasterGroup-RecommendationSystem/recommendation-engine-service/src/main.py#450-466) | varchar | Central/South/North/West |
| `created_at`, `updated_at`, `synced_at` | timestamp | Audit timestamps |

